7. execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha

Now after origin dispatch, we have vehicle_unit_alpha available, dispatch_slot_alpha available again.

Now we can release operator from origin and detach task profile.

8. release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha
9. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Now destination dispatch prep (we already have transport leg assembled and loading authorized from steps 3-4). Destination is already locked/confirmed.

