Step13: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma
Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true), not vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (init false? Actually init does not have vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta, so false), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma (true after? vehicle_unit_gamma was available init and never used). Effect: vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma true, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma false.

